# Enemy prototype: negating the enemy's effects (Infinite Impermanence) does not remove its
# HP rules - they are rule effects that cannot be negated. TEST VALUES.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
draw_per_turn 1 0
card 0 mzone 89631139       # Blue-Eyes White Dragon 3000
card 0 hand 10045474        # Infinite Impermanence
card 0 deck 15025844 x10
card 1 mzone 990000001 fu_def

0 idle sset 10045474
0 idle end
1 idle end
0 idle activate 10045474    # negate the enemy's effects until the end of the turn
0 select 990000001
0 idle battle
0 battle attack 89631139    # 3000 > DEF 2000
0 select 990000001
expect hp 990000001 2200 3200
expect count 1 mzone 1
expect destroyed 990000001 not destroyed
stop
